# Repository boundaries

## Observed systems

### Entity: Contracts

Solidity contracts, ENS adapters/interfaces, tests, and deployment records. Records are not live-health evidence.

```yaml
entity: Contracts
type: component
properties:
  paths:
    default: contracts/
states: [observed]
```

### Entity: Shared

Shared feed and Trigger contracts, computation, exported ABIs, and deployment addresses. Review together with Solidity when their interface changes.

```yaml
entity: Shared
type: component
properties:
  paths:
    default: packages/shared/
states: [observed]
```

### Entity: Pipeline

Current TypeScript file-backed feed API, ingestion/computation, tests, and pinned buoy/toxin/geographic inputs. FastAPI is planned under #82.

```yaml
entity: Pipeline
type: component
properties:
  paths:
    default: pipeline/
states: [observed]
```

### Entity: Application

Current Next.js UI/routes, keeper, wallet/identity flows, event handling, and LINE integration. Astro migration is planned under #54.

```yaml
entity: Application
type: component
properties:
  paths:
    default: web/
states: [observed]
```

### Entity: Tooling

Bun workspace configuration, dependency lock, repository scripts, CI, and agent settings.

```yaml
entity: Tooling
type: component
properties:
  paths:
    default: scripts/ .github/ .claude/ package.json bun.lock tsconfig.base.json skills-lock.json .gitignore .gitmodules
states: [observed]
```

### Entity: Documentation

Product description, architecture, integration contracts, and repository instructions.

```yaml
entity: Documentation
type: component
properties:
  paths:
    default: README.md CLAUDE.md docs/
states: [observed]
```

## Planned systems

### Entity: AstroApplication

Astro frontend and app-core, owned by #54/#56/#63. No completed migration is claimed.

```yaml
entity: AstroApplication
type: planned
properties:
  status:
    default: planned
states: [planned]
```

### Entity: FastApiRisk

Python/FastAPI risk API and producer schemas, owned by #82/#79. Verify live data through #36/#77.

```yaml
entity: FastApiRisk
type: planned
properties:
  status:
    default: planned
states: [planned]
```

### Entity: Postgres

Separate app/risk schemas with agreed geographic ownership, planned under #57/#59/#62.

```yaml
entity: Postgres
type: planned
properties:
  status:
    default: planned
states: [planned]
```

## Relationships

### Relationship: Contracts → Shared

```yaml
relationship: Contracts -> Shared
verb: exports
description: Contract ABI and Trigger agreement; coordinated review required.
```

### Relationship: Pipeline → Shared

```yaml
relationship: Pipeline -> Shared
verb: depends_on
description: Existing feed schemas and deterministic computation.
```

### Relationship: Application → Shared

```yaml
relationship: Application -> Shared
verb: depends_on
description: Existing consumer validation, ABI calls, and signing types.
```

### Relationship: AstroApplication → FastApiRisk

```yaml
relationship: AstroApplication -> FastApiRisk
verb: depends_on
description: Planned typed handoff under #55/#79; not observed runtime traffic.
```

### Relationship: AstroApplication → Postgres

```yaml
relationship: AstroApplication -> Postgres
verb: depends_on
description: Planned persistence under #62; not an existing database deployment claim.
```
